## PROGRESSIVE DOCUMENTATION v2 — PER-PHASE WRITE CONTRACT (MANDATORY)

> **Source of truth**: `r-genie/Agent_Builder/lib/docs/prompt-engineering-patterns.md` Pattern #20 v2.
> **Five Mechanics**: see `@02_Guidance.mdc` Section "Progressive Documentation v2".

| Phase | Writes Section | Marker | Mode |
|-------|----------------|--------|------|
| **0** | Skeleton (all 12 markers) + §1 Business Context | `<!-- SECTION: business-technical-context -->` | Skeleton + targeted edit |
| **1** | §2 Recommended Architecture | `<!-- SECTION: recommended-architecture -->` | Targeted edit |
| **2** | §3 Architecture Diagram (Mermaid block) | `<!-- SECTION: architecture-diagram -->` | Targeted edit |
| **3** | §4 Data Model + §5 Lucidchart Instructions | `<!-- SECTION: data-model-design -->`, `<!-- SECTION: data-model-diagram -->` | 2 targeted edits (sub-stops between) |
| **4** | §6 Integration & Event Pattern | `<!-- SECTION: integration-event-pattern -->` | Targeted edit |
| **5** | §7 Automation & Orchestration | `<!-- SECTION: automation-orchestration -->` | Targeted edit |
| **6** | §8 Security & Compliance | `<!-- SECTION: security-compliance -->` | Targeted edit |
| **7** | §9 Scalability + §10 Reusability | `<!-- SECTION: scalability-performance -->`, `<!-- SECTION: reusability-productization -->` | 2 targeted edits (sub-stops between) |
| **8** | §11 Risks + §12 References → CONSOLIDATE | `<!-- SECTION: risks-mitigations -->`, `<!-- SECTION: references -->` | 2 edits + cross-section polish |

**Per-edit budget**: ≤300 lines per `edit` (target), ≤500 lines absolute ceiling.
**Forbidden**: chat-only accumulation across phases; full-file regeneration to update one section; shell-based mutation of the `.md` file (Gap #15).

