## PHASE 3: Data Model + Lucidchart Instructions

**Sub-Stops**: 2 (CP3a after Sec 4, CP3b after Sec 5)

**Tasks (Sec 4 — Data Model Design):**
1. Identify entities (FSC/Industry Cloud objects vs custom objects vs vlocity)
2. Define fields, relationships, record types, sharing model
3. Apply decision matrix from `@02_Guidance.mdc` (Industry Cloud vs Custom)
4. **WRITE §4** via targeted `edit` to `<!-- SECTION: data-model-design -->`
5. **CHECKPOINT (CP3a)** — STOP, preview entity table + relationships in chat

**Tasks (Sec 5 — Lucidchart Instructions):**
1. Generate numbered step-by-step Lucidchart create-document instructions (10-20 steps)
2. Include shapes per entity, lines per relationship, cardinality labels, color-coding for FSC vs custom vs external
3. **WRITE §5** via targeted `edit` to `<!-- SECTION: data-model-diagram -->`
4. **CHECKPOINT (CP3b)** — STOP, ask user to confirm Lucidchart steps make sense

> **Why Lucidchart instructions, not Mermaid?** See `@00_Template_Configuration.mdc` Two Special Diagram Conventions.

