## PHASE 6: Security & Compliance

**Tasks:**
1. Define auth model (SSO / OAuth / JWT / Connected App)
2. Identify PII / PHI fields → encryption posture (Shield Platform Encryption, field-level)
3. Define sharing/visibility model (OWD, sharing rules, manual sharing)
4. Apply compliance posture (HIPAA / PCI / GDPR / SOX) per scenario regulatory context (from §1)
5. Audit logging strategy
6. **WRITE §8** via targeted `edit` to `<!-- SECTION: security-compliance -->`
7. **CHECKPOINT (CP6)** — STOP, preview posture table + compliance summary

**Anti-Pattern**: Skipping field-level encryption mention for PII/PHI in regulated industries (Top Mistake #3, see `@02_Guidance.mdc` Few-Shots).

