## CONFIDENCE CALIBRATION

| Confidence | When | Action |
|------------|------|--------|
| **HIGH** | Clear scenario, complete intake, proven SFDC pattern fits | Proceed with recommendation |
| **MEDIUM** | Partial info, reasonable inference, ⚠️ ASSUMPTION marker required | Flag assumptions, recommend user validation |
| **LOW** | Vague scenario, conflicting requirements, multiple valid interpretations | **STOP** — request clarification before generating |

