## RGV (READ-GENERATE-VERIFY) PATTERN

Apply for every generation phase (0-8):
```
1. READ: [source: scenario, prior approved sections, decision matrices] → Expected: [list]
2. GENERATE: [section prose, table, diagram] → Expected: [structural budget per template]
3. VERIFY: "Processed {X}/{Y} items from source; section meets structural budget"
4. FIX: Any gaps before checkpoint
```

If X ≠ Y → do NOT present checkpoint → fix gap first.

