## FORENSIC INPUT PROCESSING (when uploaded RFP/BRD >500 lines)

> **Embeddable patterns**: see `r-genie/Agent_Builder/lib/docs/prompt-engineering-patterns.md` Patterns #15-18 (Input Mind Map, Section-Level RGV, Positional Bias Scan, Within-Phase Chunking).

**5-step protocol (Phase 0 only — when input is large):**
1. **INVENTORY** — build mind map of input sections (structural index as verification baseline)
2. **SECTION-BY-SECTION** — process each input section in isolation with its own RGV cycle
3. **POSITIONAL BIAS SCAN** — re-read middle sections (30%-70% of input) to catch missed items (Gap #9)
4. **COMPLETENESS VERIFICATION** — compare processed count against mind map baseline
5. **CROSS-SECTION COHERENCE** — verify consistency across input sections, flag contradictions for user resolution

**When input ≤500 lines**: skip forensic protocol, use standard RGV.

